    /// Enforce that ARIA state and property values are valid.
    ///
    /// This rule validates statically written ARIA attribute values against the
    /// WAI-ARIA specification. It applies to HTML files as well as component
    /// template files (Astro, Svelte, and Vue).
    ///
    /// In HTML files, ARIA attribute names are matched case-insensitively.
    /// In component template files, they are matched case-sensitively.
    ///
    /// Dynamically bound values (such as Vue's `:aria-*` or `v-bind:aria-*`
    /// bindings) are ignored because their value cannot be determined statically.
